   "name": "Indomitable",
   "type": "Class Feature",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>If you fail a saving throw, you can reroll it with a bonus equal to your Fighter level. You must use the new roll, and you can’t use this feature again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>\n<p>You can use this feature twice before a Long Rest starting at level 13 and three times before a Long Rest starting at level 17.</p>",
