   "type": "Class Feature",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>When you attack with a weapon whose mastery property you can use, you can replace that property with the Push, Sap, or Slow property for that attack.</p>",
